### Get all services
GET http://localhost:3000/services HTTP/1.1

### Get service by code
GET http://localhost:3000/services/REG-CUT HTTP/1.1

### Get services by category
GET http://localhost:3000/services/category/haircut HTTP/1.1

### Get promo services
GET http://localhost:3000/services/promos HTTP/1.1

### Create new service
POST http://localhost:3000/services HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceCode": "TEST-CUT",
  "serviceName": "Test Haircut",
  "serviceCategory": "haircut",
  "serviceDescription": "Test haircut service",
  "servicePrice": 200.00,
  "servicePromo": 0,
  "servicePromoPrice": 0,
  "serviceValidity": "ACTIVE"
}

### Update service
PUT http://localhost:3000/services/TEST-CUT HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "servicePrice": 250.00,
  "servicePromo": 1,
  "servicePromoPrice": 200.00
}

### Delete service
DELETE http://localhost:3000/services/TEST-CUT HTTP/1.1
